# Frontend conventions

## Auth & session

- Session/user state lives in Auth context (`context/`)
- Read auth via `useAuth` (or existing hook); do not re-parse localStorage ad hoc in UI
- Role-based routing stays in `routes/` (employee vs manager)

## API

- HTTP client: Axios in `services/api`
- Base URL from env (`VITE_*`), not hardcoded hosts in components
- Prefer centralized handling for 401 (interceptor) over per-page reloads/alerts

## UX feedback

- Prefer inline form/page error messages over `alert()`
- Keep pages in `pages/`, reusable UI in `components/`

## Style

- Match existing component and naming patterns
- Do not add new domain features unless explicitly requested
